"trimesh_pieces": 1.0,
"use": "温泉旅館 (a hot-spring inn in the snow mountains): two storeys 36 x 20 m, enterable (_Shop) -- the 玄関 with shoes off (a stone doma, 下足箱, the agarikamachi up to the 0.3 m floor), the 帳場 front desk, the lobby and the 売店; the 大浴場 split 男湯 / 女湯 behind 暖簾 (脱衣所 with basket shelves, a hinoki 内湯, the wash row) each with a door out to its bamboo-fenced 露天風呂 on a stone terrace; the tatami 宴会場 and the kitchen (its own back door); upstairs eleven 和室 guest rooms (tatami, a low table, the 広縁 window strip) off a central corridor; two stairs, a lift; snow on the roof, the porch and the drive. The bath water is a solid placeholder surface. probe_xz is under the porch roof. kits/interiors/OnsenRyokan.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
"wall_top_m": 3.55
}

